": "1468113317689105", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393901_1468113321022438_5301992700359513093_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EhwyIQGfO4IQ7kNvwHTDBVP&_nc_oc=Adk6R4_UeXduZggNV7jCHhk_Ycbqffe241n4Q4tTjGEG4P5s_vcSRiTw0HTBSwkLiuI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsIAcJDyHBW9H19vA_r3k0pSkK-pMKYhbZa9QEoB1uT5w&oe=69A6C7C6"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "1183010303571395", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393491_1183010306904728_6851860163469096445_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=X2H6ikx6RzEQ7kNvwHeK9xD&_nc_oc=AdkXmKy--wFaxwGUsZq-vxAQQHz_yP-YxLqHttjlrvu-xWbcMvV2kUnJgFp3E03lzaM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aft1UQDL7ba0ReZ_-twTLwhGmW_gHsNMVpBGhO1_OgU9og&oe=69A6C4A3"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "1358340778764461", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473402211_1358340782097794_7615245122570796576_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Z2oFPTsvsqMQ7kNvwHP9n35&_nc_oc=Adm_jreCA06b_SE2P26otPrEWjDD1VelmIumUXSqZrVBCe36wl0rvwLy75WJuk6Vu0w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afubsl0D126hnQvl-qxJ6RrD3JSmOJoZUnsi7e8KULuR_g&oe=69A6DB6B"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "1023722979911327", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824623_1023722983244660_6615002093131769634_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QylNUdVrfIQQ7kNvwGEckxZ&_nc_oc=AdnYbcELLjMoO7mEe8xu-1ChezY4EeWL5sldZHwfwe-ZpxnqhAwCfsHZdhgegCMAL-g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsK15DbS427R_5teBT8FCvRc4NsHZ9V3oxLuUPs_LGQ-A&oe=69A6E057"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "1062837435691242", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392048_1062837442357908_3730609957565045373_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=I8sPlhxYxuwQ7kNvwG1oFUp&_nc_oc=AdmgJLiulagZQvvxhQrbNMCoUQa4IwIv_pwx9IKJVXFBDt8Y_7_n0TQt76_7hx-HNVA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afv3iFgsok5XoqpmFP903NadLk5Yjd7fXjUHfyuxm7R0XA&oe=69A6F0D3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Car War Vr: RC Stunt Game", "keywords": ["driving", "race", "mini", "drift", "fight"], "long_description": "Car War VR: RC Stunt Game is an action-packed VR racing and combat game that puts you in control of high-powered remote control cars armed to the teeth. Designed exclusively for virtual reality, this single-player experience combines arcade-style racing, vehicle combat, and extreme stunt driving into one adrenaline-fueled package.\nStrap into the cockpit view of your RC war machine and enter explosive arenas filled with jumps, ramps, and AI enemies. Use skill, speed, and strategy to perform jaw-dropping stunts, avoid deadly traps, and blast opponents with powerful weapons like rockets, lasers, and EMPs.\nCustomize your car with a variety of upgrades\u2014boosters, armor, wheels, and weapons\u2014to suit your combat style. Explore unique environments, from backyard battlegrounds to sci-fi stunt zones, each crafted for fast-paced, chaotic fun.\nKey Features:\nImmersive VR racing combat with intuitive controls\n\n\nHigh-speed, physics-driven RC stunt action\n\n\n- Customizable cars with unlockable weapons and gadgets\n- Challenging single-player missions and smart AI opponents\n- Explosive visuals with slow-motion effects and dynamic crashes\n\nExperience the thrill of car battles in VR like never before. Car War VR: RC Stunt Game is the ultimate test of your reflexes, creativity, and combat driving skills.", "short_description": "Race, drift, and stunt in this high-speed RC car VR experience! Build custom tracks, upgrade your ride, and compete solo in action-packed challenges. Designed for Meta Quest, this immersive racing game brings remote control fun to life with realistic physics and endless creativity."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://vhype.tech/CarwarPolicy", "developer_terms_of_servi